{"seq":1,"slug":"abuse-response-ladder-enforcement","title":"滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/response-budget-guardrail-ops/abuse-response-ladder-enforcement","wordCount":2795,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环\">滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环</h1><p>上一章把滥用识别成了「风险分」，但一个 0.87 的分值本身不构成任何业务动作：它既没有阻止那笔领券，也没有在事后告诉用户为什么被拦。真正决定损失边界与用户信任的，是<strong>从分值到处置动作的那段映射</strong>，以及这段映射能否被申诉推翻、被审计重放。本章处理的就是这段——把风控输出变成一套可升降档、可回滚、可申诉的分级处罚执行闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-处置是一段可申诉的状态机-不是一次封号\">核心概念：处置是一段可申诉的状态机，不是一次封号</h2><p>电商团队最危险的直觉是把处置等同于「封号」。实际上封号是阶梯的最后一档，而绝大多数真实滥用——一支被批量囤的券、一个当日超领的账号——需要的只是<strong>限速、降额、撤销未核销权益</strong>这类可逆动作。把这类场景直接推到封号，等于用最高成本产生最大的误杀，而误杀的代价并不比漏放低。处置阶梯（enforcement ladder）的核心是把「风险等级」映射到「动作强度」，并保证<strong>每一档动作的强度与其可逆性成反比</strong>：轻档可自动回滚，重档必须人工审批且留痕。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>档位</th>\n<th>触发信号强度</th>\n<th>典型动作</th>\n<th>用户可感知影响</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n<th>审批</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T0 观察</td>\n<td>低分但命中弱规则</td>\n<td>仅打标、加采样、进二次特征</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T1 软限制</td>\n<td>中低分（如 0.5–0.7）</td>\n<td>领券限速、单券降为每人一次、需验证码</td>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>秒级回滚</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T2 权益回收</td>\n<td>中高分 + 未核销证据</td>\n<td>撤销未使用券、作废未支付订单</td>\n<td>中度</td>\n<td>分钟级，需台账</td>\n<td>自动 + 抽检</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T3 账户限制</td>\n<td>高分 + 已核销但未发货</td>\n<td>冻结下单、限制领券 30 天、暂停提现</td>\n<td>显著</td>\n<td>需人工复核</td>\n<td>人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T4 账户清退</td>\n<td>高分 + 团伙证据 + 已造成损失</td>\n<td>关闭账户、追偿、拉黑设备/支付指纹</td>\n<td>永久</td>\n<td>不可逆</td>\n<td>双人审批</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套阶梯在合规上不是可选项。GDPR 第 22 条限制「仅基于自动化处理」做出的、对用户产生法律效果或类似重大影响的决定，并要求在此类决定下提供<strong>人工介入、表达观点、质疑决定</strong>的保障（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-22-gdpr/\">GDPR Art. 22</a>）。换言之，T3/T4 这类重度动作必须有申诉通道，而 T0–T2 可以自动执行，因为它们是可逆且影响轻微的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[风险分与证据包] --&gt; M{档位映射}&#10;  M --&gt;|T0| T0[观察打标]&#10;  M --&gt;|T1| T1[软限制]&#10;  M --&gt;|T2| T2[权益回收]&#10;  M --&gt;|T3| T3[账户限制]&#10;  M --&gt;|T4| T4[账户清退]&#10;  T1 --&gt; A{用户申诉?}&#10;  T2 --&gt; A&#10;  T3 --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt;|否| K[维持当前档, 进入观察期]&#10;  A --&gt;|是| H[人工复核: 看证据不看分数]&#10;  H --&gt;|误杀| U[回滚并恢复权益]&#10;  H --&gt;|成立| K&#10;  K --&gt; O{观察期内复发?}&#10;  O --&gt;|是| S[升一档]&#10;  O --&gt;|否| D[到期降档或解除]&#10;  S --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  R[风险分与证据包] --&gt; M{档位映射}\n  M --&gt;|T0| T0[观察打标]\n  M --&gt;|T1| T1[软限制]\n  M --&gt;|T2| T2[权益回收]\n  M --&gt;|T3| T3[账户限制]\n  M --&gt;|T4| T4[账户清退]\n  T1 --&gt; A{用户申诉?}\n  T2 --&gt; A\n  T3 --&gt; A\n  A --&gt;|否| K[维持当前档, 进入观察期]\n  A --&gt;|是| H[人工复核: 看证据不看分数]\n  H --&gt;|误杀| U[回滚并恢复权益]\n  H --&gt;|成立| K\n  K --&gt; O{观察期内复发?}\n  O --&gt;|是| S[升一档]\n  O --&gt;|否| D[到期降档或解除]\n  S --&gt; M</pre><p>状态机的价值在于把「处罚」变成「状态迁移 + 观察期 + 升降档规则」，而不是一次性布尔判定。没有观察期与降档路径的阶梯，会持续累积用户，把中档惩罚变成事实上的永久封禁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从分数到动作-档位映射的判据不能只看分数\">从分数到动作：档位映射的判据不能只看分数</h2><p>单阈值映射（「分 &gt; 0.8 就封」）在实践中必然误杀，因为分数只表达「像不像滥用」，不表达「造成了多大损失、是否可逆」。映射函数至少要含三个变量：<strong>风险分</strong>、<strong>已造成的可量化损失</strong>、<strong>证据是否归属到已确认的团伙</strong>。判据应按「预期净损失」而非「概率」排序：动作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的期望代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>abuse</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>abuse</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>legit</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{cost} \\mid a] = P(\\text{abuse}) \\cdot L_{\\text{abuse}} \\cdot (1 - e_a) + P(\\text{legit}) \\cdot C_{\\text{friction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">abuse</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">legit</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>abuse</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{abuse}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是不处置将发生的预期损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是拦截效力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{friction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是误伤的摩擦与支持成本。T4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{friction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极高（流失、退款、口碑、申诉工单），只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>abuse</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{abuse})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">abuse</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>abuse</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{abuse}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 同时很高、且证据属于已确认团伙时才该触发。</p>\n<p>支撑「团伙确认」这一步的信号来自跨账号关联。同一支付指纹下的 40 个账号同日领同一批券，与单个账号领了 3 张券，风险分可能相同但处置档位应差两级。这一层的图谱构造与特征来源见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../abuse-detection-graph-signals/abuse-identity-graph-device-payment-link\">身份图谱：设备与支付关联</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"处罚执行的工程实现-幂等命令-动作台账-可回滚\">处罚执行的工程实现：幂等命令、动作台账、可回滚</h2><p>把「封这个账号」当成一次直接写库，是执行环节最常见的结构缺陷。正确形态是<strong>把每个处置表达为一条幂等命令</strong>：<code>{action: T2_REVOKE_COUPONS, subject_id, reason_code, evidence_ref, operator, idempotency_key}</code>，由执行器消费并对多下游系统扇出。</p>\n<p>需要扇出的下游通常有五个，且它们的一致性级别不同：<strong>券/预算系统</strong>（撤销未核销券并归还池额度，必须与预算扣减共享原子性边界，否则制造假超发或泄漏，参见 <a href=\"../coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/budget-overrun-reconciliation-incident\">预算击穿对账与超发事故处置</a>）；<strong>订单系统</strong>（取消未支付/未发货订单，落为可审计状态迁移）；<strong>支付与提现</strong>（暂停提现、必要时追偿）；<strong>风控系统</strong>（下发设备/支付指纹黑名单）；<strong>账户系统</strong>（置为受限或关闭）。</p>\n<p>扇出意味着<strong>处置不是瞬时的、也不总是原子的</strong>：某些下游成功、某些失败，系统会短暂处于「半处置」状态，因此执行器必须支持<strong>幂等补偿与重试</strong>。AWS 构建者文库给出过量化警示：多层重试叠加可把下游负载放大到 <strong>243 倍</strong>，并明确「重试是自私的」，对策是把重试限制在单一层级、使用带上限的指数退避并加抖动，再用<strong>重试令牌桶预算</strong>约束突发（<a href=\"https://builder.aws.com/content/3EumjoZascWd1oZiEgL8ORlv3qE/timeouts-retries-and-backoff-with-jitter\">AWS Builders&#39; Library: Timeouts, retries and backoff with jitter</a>）。一次误判触发的批量清退若被无条件重试，会把本就脆弱的支付与订单链路直接压垮。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[处置命令&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 + 理由码 + 证据引用] --&gt; Q[命令队列/动作台账]&#10;  Q --&gt; E[执行器]&#10;  E --&gt; D1[券与预算: 撤销并归还]&#10;  E --&gt; D2[订单: 取消未履行]&#10;  E --&gt; D3[支付: 暂停提现/追偿]&#10;  E --&gt; D4[风控: 指纹黑名单]&#10;  E --&gt; D5[账户: 置受限/关闭]&#10;  D1 --&gt; V{所有下游确认?}&#10;  D2 --&gt; V&#10;  D3 --&gt; V&#10;  D4 --&gt; V&#10;  D5 --&gt; V&#10;  V --&gt;|否, 部分失败| R[退避重试 + 补偿]&#10;  V --&gt;|是| L[写完成事件, 通知用户理由]&#10;  R --&gt; V\">graph TD\n  C[处置命令&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 + 理由码 + 证据引用] --&gt; Q[命令队列/动作台账]\n  Q --&gt; E[执行器]\n  E --&gt; D1[券与预算: 撤销并归还]\n  E --&gt; D2[订单: 取消未履行]\n  E --&gt; D3[支付: 暂停提现/追偿]\n  E --&gt; D4[风控: 指纹黑名单]\n  E --&gt; D5[账户: 置受限/关闭]\n  D1 --&gt; V{所有下游确认?}\n  D2 --&gt; V\n  D3 --&gt; V\n  D4 --&gt; V\n  D5 --&gt; V\n  V --&gt;|否, 部分失败| R[退避重试 + 补偿]\n  V --&gt;|是| L[写完成事件, 通知用户理由]\n  R --&gt; V</pre><p>动作台账（action ledger）是审计基础：每条记录含动作、主体、理由码、证据引用、操作者、幂等键、执行结果与时间戳，且<strong>只追加不修改</strong>。DSA 第 17 条要求平台在对用户施加限制时提供<strong>理由说明（statement of reasons）</strong>，含事实、依据的规则与补救途径（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2022/2065/oj\">Regulation (EU) 2022/2065 (DSA), Art. 17</a>）。没有台账，就无法生成说明，也无法在申诉时重放当初为何这样判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误杀控制与申诉闭环\">误杀控制与申诉闭环</h2><p>处置系统的目标从来不是把风险分打准，而是<strong>在给定误杀成本下最小化总损失</strong>。误杀率每上升一个百分点，代价是支持工单、退款、社媒声量与用户流失；而拦截率每下降一点，代价是直接的促销预算外流。二者由同一阈值控制，因此<strong>阈值的选取是一次业务权衡，不是模型指标问题</strong>。</p>\n<p>对申诉闭环而言，最有价值的指标是<strong>申诉翻案率（overturn rate）</strong>：它是对误杀率的直接测量。翻案率长期偏高（例如超过 20–30%）说明阈值或证据质量出了问题；翻案率接近零反而可疑，可能意味着申诉入口形同虚设、用户根本不知道可以申诉。</p>\n<p>申诉闭环的工程要点有四：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>入口与时限</strong>：DSA 第 20 条要求在线平台建立<strong>内部投诉处理系统</strong>，勤勉、非任意地处理投诉；第 21 条进一步要求允许用户将争议提交<strong>庭外争议解决机构</strong>（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2022/2065/oj\">DSA Art. 20–21</a>）。系统上这意味着申诉必须有明确入口、处理时限与可查询状态。</li>\n<li><strong>复核看证据不看分数</strong>：人工复核者应看到关联图谱、原始事件、金额，而非一个打包好的结论性分值——否则复核只是复述模型，不构成 GDPR 第 22 条意义上的「人工介入」。</li>\n<li><strong>一键回滚</strong>：误杀判定后必须能按动作台账逐项恢复（归还券、恢复账户、解除指纹），这要求每档动作在结构上可逆。</li>\n<li><strong>影模式放量</strong>：任何新规则或新阈值上线前，先在**影模式（shadow mode）**下只打标不执行，观测若执行的误杀规模，再按比例放量。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>误杀与漏放由同一阈值控制，因此<strong>阈值的选取是一次业务权衡，不是模型指标问题</strong>。设阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，总期望成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>legit</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>abuse</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t) = N_{\\text{legit}} \\cdot FPR(t) \\cdot C_{\\text{fp}} + N_{\\text{abuse}} \\cdot FNR(t) \\cdot C_{\\text{fn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">legit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">abuse</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，最优阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^* = \\arg\\min_t C(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 明显偏向成本更高的一侧。对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>fn</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{fn}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fn</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高价值老客群体，系统应使用<strong>更保守的阈值</strong>，而不是全站一个数——这既是业务理性，也是合规上「措施应与风险相称」的落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标与运营节奏\">指标与运营节奏</h2><p>处置闭环必须用一组固定的运营指标驱动，且要能区分「检测慢」与「执行慢」两类根因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>退化信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检测延迟</td>\n<td>滥用发生到首次打标</td>\n<td>上升 → 图谱/实时特征滞后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行延迟</td>\n<td>打标到处置生效</td>\n<td>上升 → 下游耦合或重试风暴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申诉翻案率</td>\n<td>申诉中被推翻的比例</td>\n<td>过高 → 阈值或证据质量差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置覆盖率</td>\n<td>已处置损失 / 识别到的损失</td>\n<td>过低 → 档位映射保守或执行失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单档复发率</td>\n<td>观察期内同主体再犯比例</td>\n<td>过高 → 阶梯起点过低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运营节奏上，处置规则与阈值应作为<strong>可版本化的配置</strong>管理，每次变更记录理由、影响面与回滚点。DSA 第 23 条要求在线平台公开<strong>内容审核相关措施的透明度报告</strong>，若处罚规则频繁无痕变更，既无法对外说明，也无法在事故时定位是哪次阈值调整引入了误杀潮（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2022/2065/oj\">DSA Art. 23</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处置是<strong>可申诉的状态机</strong>，不是一次封号：T0 观察到 T4 清退的五档，强度与可逆性成反比，轻档自动、重档人工且留痕。</li>\n<li>档位映射不能只看分数：判据应含<strong>风险分、可量化损失、团伙证据</strong>三要素，用期望净损失而非概率排序；团伙确认依赖跨账号图谱，见 <a href=\"../abuse-detection-graph-signals/abuse-identity-graph-device-payment-link\">身份图谱：设备与支付关联</a>。</li>\n<li>合规边界是硬的：GDPR 第 22 条要求重度自动化决定提供人工介入与质疑权，DSA 第 17/20/21/23 条要求理由说明、内部投诉处理、庭外争议解决与透明度报告。</li>\n<li>执行层必须<strong>幂等命令化 + 动作台账 + 可补偿重试</strong>：扇出到券预算、订单、支付、风控、账户五个下游，半处置状态是常态，重试须用退避加抖动与令牌桶预算，避免 243 倍放大（AWS Builders&#39; Library）。</li>\n<li>误杀用<strong>申诉翻案率</strong>直接测量；复核要看证据不看分数；新规则先跑影模式再放量；高价值群体用更保守阈值。</li>\n<li>运营看<strong>检测延迟、执行延迟、翻案率、处置覆盖率、单档复发率</strong>五组指标；规则与阈值作为可版本化配置管理。</li>\n<li>权益回收这一档必须与预算池的原子扣减对齐，否则处置本身就会制造假超发或泄漏，参见 <a href=\"../coupon-stack-rule-budget-engine/budget-overrun-reconciliation-incident\">预算击穿对账与超发事故处置</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环","id":"滥用分级处置与处罚执行闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：处置是一段可申诉的状态机，不是一次封号","id":"核心概念-处置是一段可申诉的状态机-不是一次封号"},{"level":2,"text":"从分数到动作：档位映射的判据不能只看分数","id":"从分数到动作-档位映射的判据不能只看分数"},{"level":2,"text":"处罚执行的工程实现：幂等命令、动作台账、可回滚","id":"处罚执行的工程实现-幂等命令-动作台账-可回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"误杀控制与申诉闭环","id":"误杀控制与申诉闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"指标与运营节奏","id":"指标与运营节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"误伤治理与对抗规避：把误报成本与规避成本放进同一本预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/abuse-detection-graph-signals/detection-false-positive-adversarial-evasion"},"next":{"title":"促销护栏熔断与降级机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/response-budget-guardrail-ops/promo-guardrail-circuit-breaker"}}